# Requests for the IDE's HTTP client. Run `dotnet run -- seed` first.
@host = http://localhost:8001

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Museums, sorted by name
GET {{host}}/api/museums

### One museum by slug, with floor plans and points of interest
GET {{host}}/api/museums/galleria-degli-uffizi

### Its artworks (type is case-sensitive: ?type=artwork is a 400)
GET {{host}}/api/museums/galleria-degli-uffizi/contents?type=Artwork

### Log in as a demo user; paste the token below
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "autore1", "password": "12345678" }

###
@token = paste-the-token-here

### Current user, with their visits and saved visits
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recharge the wallet
PATCH {{host}}/api/auth/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50 }

### A visit by slug (the answer keys only for its author)
GET {{host}}/api/visits/uffizi-in-gruppo-dal-medioevo-a-caravaggio
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
